# Licence

This repository contains two kinds of thing under two licences.

---

## The data — Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)

Applies to: `ledger/`, `archive/`, `public/ledger.json`, `public/ledger.csv`, and the record content
rendered on ledger.kingy.ai.

You are free to share and adapt it, including commercially, provided you give appropriate credit and
indicate if changes were made.

Attribute as: **Quota Reset Index — https://ledger.kingy.ai**

Full licence: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

> This is the licence declared in the site's `schema.org/Dataset` markup, and it is declared here so
> that claim is backed by something rather than merely asserted.

**A request that is not a licence condition:** if you find a record wrong, say so against the
evidence. Every record cites its sources precisely so it can be checked, and a correction is more
useful to this project than a citation.

